{"schemaVersion":1,"id":453,"sections":[{"id":"1812001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20581],"start":0,"count":30},{"id":"1812001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20582],"start":30,"count":21}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:1","scriptId":20581,"text":"丝黛罗佩和阿尔库涅，目前以赛琳娜和艾丽莎的匿名身份在周游世界。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:2","scriptId":20581,"text":"夜幕之下，这两名上位旅行者正准备开始她们的列车之旅。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:3","scriptId":20581,"text":"“这趟打算去哪儿？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:4","scriptId":20581,"text":"丝黛罗佩手里拿着一本旅游杂志向身前的阿尔库涅问道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:5","scriptId":20581,"text":"由于泰莱塔的突袭计划导致世界各地一度战火四起，很多景点在战时都被迫关闭了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:6","scriptId":20581,"text":"直到最近战乱平息，那些旅游胜地才开始慢慢恢复开放。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:7","scriptId":20581,"text":"“阿尔卑斯山。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:8","scriptId":20581,"text":"阿尔库涅一边说着，一边跨入列车的车厢，身后的丝黛罗佩也跟着上了列车。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:9","scriptId":20581,"text":"“哦？这个名字我之前好像听梅洛佩提过。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:10","scriptId":20581,"text":"“是的，她有吩咐让我去调查地球上的源铁。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:11","scriptId":20581,"text":"“哦，还有这么回事的啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:12","scriptId":20581,"text":"既然是梅洛佩吩咐的事情，那丝黛罗佩自然没有异议，只不过她没想到阿尔库涅竟然不是单纯的为了游玩而行动。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:13","scriptId":20581,"text":"“不过嘛~顺便游玩一下啦，阿尔卑斯山那儿有不少的古迹来着。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:14","scriptId":20581,"text":"“恩～既然小阿尔这么说了，就这么做吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:15","scriptId":20581,"text":"“谢谢，如果泰莱塔也这么通情达理就好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:16","scriptId":20581,"text":"“那个战斗狂就算了吧，她的娱乐项目里只有暴力，你还是别管她了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:17","scriptId":20581,"text":"“唉……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:18","scriptId":20581,"text":"阿尔库涅叹了口气，望向窗外。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:19","scriptId":20581,"text":"这一望让阿尔库涅看到了奇怪的东西。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:20","scriptId":20581,"text":"“那是什么东西？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:21","scriptId":20581,"text":"阿尔库涅把手伸出窗外直指天空。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:22","scriptId":20581,"text":"“有什么东西吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:23","scriptId":20581,"text":"看到阿尔库涅的反应，丝黛罗佩走到了窗边。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:24","scriptId":20581,"text":"“哦，你是说那个一闪一闪的吧？看上去像是会飞的虫子，可能是飞行战车兽吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:25","scriptId":20581,"text":"丝黛罗佩也看到了阿尔库涅所说的怪东西——黑夜之中有个一闪一闪发着红色信号光的东西正悬浮在空中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:26","scriptId":20581,"text":"那怪东西和列车有相当一段距离，但从大小上来推断这个物体的体积可能并不小，确实有可能是战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:27","scriptId":20581,"text":"“飞行战车兽？难道是泰莱塔派来监视我们的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:28","scriptId":20581,"text":"“或许只是野生品种吧？泰莱塔没有监视我们的必要，而且她也不会用这种手段来恶心我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:29","scriptId":20581,"text":"“真的吗……？你上次干的事情我想她一定记仇了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-PROLOGUE:20581:30","scriptId":20581,"text":"“啊哈哈~你这么说好像也有可能~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:1","scriptId":20582,"text":"一道黑色的光划过夜空，一瞬之间吞噬了周围的月光，仿佛将月亮切成了两半。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":824,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:2","scriptId":20582,"text":"“怎么样，现在感觉好点了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":824,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:3","scriptId":20582,"text":"丝黛罗佩身上的聚合装甲开始慢慢崩解，刚才的那道黑光正是她发射出去的聚合光线。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":824,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:4","scriptId":20582,"text":"“恩，那让人心烦的东西已经看不见了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":824,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:5","scriptId":20582,"text":"丝黛罗佩的攻击准确无误地击中了红色亮点，刚才还在空中悬浮闪烁的红色亮点现在已经消失地无影无踪。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":824,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:6","scriptId":20582,"text":"“被聚合光线正面击中，我想应该已经尸骨无存了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:7","scriptId":20582,"text":"“不过你突然来这么一下，可能会吓到别人吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:8","scriptId":20582,"text":"阿尔库涅指了指车厢外，一些游客似乎都看到了刚才的聚合光线，纷纷跑出车厢一探究竟。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:9","scriptId":20582,"text":"“没事，我们是专用包厢，刚才发动攻击的时候我已经确认周围没人了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:10","scriptId":20582,"text":"“而且我也没用最大能耗，只是轻轻地开了一发，就像这样。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:11","scriptId":20582,"text":"丝黛罗佩用食指轻轻弹了一下桌上的水杯，发出了“叮”地一声。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:12","scriptId":20582,"text":"“丝黛罗佩姐姐真是出人意料呢，出手那么快。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:13","scriptId":20582,"text":"“我对烦人的虫子也没什么好感，于是就动手啦～而且万一真事泰莱塔派来的，那不是正好清理掉吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:14","scriptId":20582,"text":"“都还没看清楚是什么呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":826,"speaker":"赛琳娜·摩根","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:15","scriptId":20582,"text":"“能有什么大关系，反正从信号来看不是我们的人。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":826,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:17","scriptId":20582,"text":"由于在傍晚乘坐列车的人原本就少，所以丝黛罗佩刚才的行为没有引起什么波澜。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:18","scriptId":20582,"text":"好奇心旺盛的游客并没找到他们所期望看到的东西，纷纷回到了车厢内。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:19","scriptId":20582,"text":"汽笛声响彻夜空，列车准时出发。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:21","scriptId":20582,"text":"被丝黛罗佩的攻击过的地方发生了奇异的现象。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:22","scriptId":20582,"text":"空间就像被撕裂了一样出现了一道缺口，从里面钻出一只形似战车兽的机械物体。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1117,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1812001-EPILOGUE:20582:23","scriptId":20582,"text":"“@#@#@#@#”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":1117,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
